# Keep small, reproducible benchmark evidence even when the model/checkpoint
# name contains "qwen".
!benchmarks/results/
!benchmarks/results/*.json

# Benchmark outputs: the harness is versioned, its results are not.
# REPORT.md, results.json/csv and charts are regenerated per host, and the
# compiled .aeg artifacts are large build products.
benchmark/results/*
!benchmark/results/.gitkeep

# Multi-engine suite outputs (python benchmark.py). Same reasoning: the raw
# records, figures and report belong to one host at one moment, and the compiled
# artifacts under artifacts/ are build products measured in gigabytes. Committing a
# result set is a deliberate act - copy it somewhere tracked and say which host it
# came from.
benchmark_results/
benchmark_results_*/
# Scratch output directories from local pipeline checks.
bench_out*/
bench_v*/
bench_fixture/

# Internal product requirements and publishing guides
PRD.md
PRD_v2.md
PUBLISHING.md
docs/architecture-execution-planner.html
*architecture-execution-planner*

